## 💥 Phase 2: Exploitation (Hydra Brute-Force Attack)

Using the service profiles discovered during reconnaissance, I targeted the open authentication mechanisms. Because no account lockout policies were active, I executed an automated dictionary attack using **Hydra** paired with the `rockyou.txt` wordlist.

### Attack Vector: SSH Brute-Forcing
I targeted a previously enumerated username (`admin`) to discover the corresponding password over the SSH protocol.

**Command Executed:**
```bash
hydra -l admin -P /usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt ssh://<TARGET_IP> -t 4 -V
```

